 walls even before  the fall of Shingen Tina district and  this is because he found a banned book  about the outside world that belonged to  his grandfather on top of that Armin's  parents clearly knew about the outside  world as they had actually constructed a  hot air balloon in an attempt to fly  over the walls and reach the outside  world but sadly they were killed by the  military police brigade before they  could carry out their plan but the  question is how could the alert family  have known this and how could they have  come across this banned knowledge in the  first place while reading chapter 96 of  the manga something struck me during a  conversation between Annie bertolt and  Reiner we learned that the timers were  the ones who told them our land army  that the King behind the walls is tied  down by the promise of pacifism and that  he wouldn't use the power of the  founding titan to attack Marlay even if  the walls were breached this means that  the Tiber family despite being in Marlay  still has accurate intelligence about  what is going on behind the walls and  this made me think that the Tiber x'  must have LDN spies inside the walls who  are giving them this information  could these LDN spies be members of the  Tiber family who have infiltrated the  walls generations ago and changed their  names in order to hide their identity  could Arman's ancestors be timers who  came to paradise as spies and could this  be the reason why the alert family has  access to band knowledge that they were  never supposed to possess over too many  decades the are lurtz may have stopped  being spies and become just normal LD  ends living behind the walls but the  fact is that even if armand isn't aware  of it he could have royal blood of the  Tiber family running through his veins  if armand does have royal blood then it  would make sense for him to be a Tiber  rather than a Rees if the are lurtz were  members of the Reese family as many have  speculated in the past then it is very  likely that the Reese family would have  known about their existence as they kept  a close watch on what was going on  within the  walls but if the are lurtz were members  of a different royal family the tie  burrs then they could hide inside the  walls effectively without anyone knowing  their true identity to add to this one  thing that I always thought was a major  plot hole in the attack on Titan story  and the only one that really bothers me  because otherwise I really love the  story was the fact that Marley sent four  children  Marcell Reiner bertolt and Annie two  parodies on their own now these children  may have been exceptional fighters but  how foolish would the Malayan government  be to give four Titan shifter powers  into the hands of children and send  those children into enemy territory  alone what if the children due to their  lack of experience screwed up and Marley  lost all four Titan powers to the LD ins  on the island what a massive blow that  would be to the military of Marley this  whole plan would have made a lot more  sense if Marley or at least the tiber  family had spies inside the walls who  could keep an eye on the four young  warriors to make sure that everything  was going according to plan  if we accept that the timers did in fact  have a network of spies inside the walls  a network that might have at some point  included the alert family then  everything begins to fall into place a  lot more smoothly another reason that  could suggest that Armin has royal blood  is of course his physical appearance and  many have pointed out that his hair  color eye color and other physical  characteristics suggest that he could  have royal blood in fact Arman resembles  the royal family so closely that he was  used as a body double for historia the  current Queen in addition a youtuber  known as dark logic studios even made a  video that suggests that Armin's  features including the unique shape of  his nose closely resemble the features  of Willy Tiber the head of the Tiber  family and the current holder of the  Warhammer Titan if you want to check out  that video I will leave the link in the  description it's pretty interesting  personally I don't think that Arman's  physical appearance alone is enough to  he has royal blood because there are  other blonde characters in the story who  are not Royals but when combined with  all the other factors including having  banned books I think that we can make a  pretty compelling case for Armand  potentially having royal blood and of  course if he does have royal blood this  would have major implications on the  story it means that Armand's colossus  titan power will be far more deadly than  Berthold form because LD ends with royal  blood who become shifters have greater  power and additional abilities as  compared to shifters possessed by  regular ldiots  if Armin really does have royal blood I  can only imagine how strong his Colossus  Titan will be do you think that Armin  has royal blood  could he be a member of the Tiber family  without even knowing it let me know down  in the comments and now on to any there  are a number of factors that make me  think that any could also have royal  blood and that she could also  potentially be a member of the Tiber  royal family as I mentioned at the  beginning of the video it was any  stunning resemblance to Zeke's mother  and grisha's first wife Deena Fritz aka  Deena Yeager that first got me thinking  about this remember that  ISA Emma does not draw characters in  such a similar fashion by coincidence  and we've already seen with historia  that in chapter 65 isayama deliberately  depicted her in a very similar way to  how Amir Fritz is usually depicted as  foreshadowing that just like Amir Fritz  historia would also become queen of the  ldiots aside from the fact that Annie  also has the physical features of  someone who could have royal blood  including the blond hair and blue with  gray eyes there are also some very  interesting things about Annie's  backstory that are worth thinking about  unlike most of the other warriors of  Marlay and he does not consider  inheriting the female Titan to be an  honor and she is extremely skeptical of  Marlon propaganda as if she knows  something that the others do not she  first learned how to fight from her  father when she was still a child but  this is not because she wanted to rather  her father insisted on teaching her  and one point and he says that just like  edit and Reiner her father was carried  away with ideals that had nothing to do  with reality we also see in chapter 33  Andy's father apologizing to her saying  that he was wrong about something and he  warns her to see the whole world as her  enemy now her father might have trained  a knee because he wanted her to be a  warrior so that their family could get  honorary merlion status but that's only  one possibility although many assumed  that Annie is from the lab aerial  internment Zone we don't have  confirmation of this the few scenes that  we do see of Annie and her father  appeared to be happening somewhere out  in nature which doesn't look likely  Barry owed to me so what if Annie and  her father were not actually regular LD  ins living in lis burial what if they  were members of the tiber family but for  some reason they fell out of favor with  the rest of the timers maybe Annie's  father did something wrong something  against the timers which would explain  him apologizing and saying he was wrong  maybe the reason Annie became a warrior  was not to get honorary Marlon  citizenship but rather as a way for her  family to make up for her father's  mistake whatever it was and to get back  into the tiber family's good graces if  Annie's father's ideals led him to  believe in the Marlon cause like Ryder's  mother then why would he warned Annie  that she should see the whole world as  her enemy the whole world would of  course include Marlay so it wouldn't be  too far of a stretch to say that Annie's  father was not really a supporter of the  Malayan military and he may have been a  rogue Tibor who did something wrong such  as helping the LDN restorationist for  instance and who was forced to give up  his daughter to the warrior program in  order to atone for his sin also let's  not forget that Annie's female Titan has  some very unique abilities along with  having high endurance impressive  versatility on different types of  terrain and the ability to harden parts  of her body and he can also control  mindless Titans by calling them to her  with her voice remember  that the only other Titan shifters that  have demonstrated the ability to control  mindless Titans are defunding Titan and  the Beast IP now here's the important  thing the founding Titan can control  mindless titans when it is possessed by  a member of the royal family and by  Annan only when he comes into direct  contact with royal blood  in his case Deana Yeager in her smiling  Titan form the current beast Titan has  unique abilities that no previous beast  Titan had and he can control mindless  Titans because its current possessor is  Zeke Yeager Dena son who also has royal  blood so wise Annie's female Titan the  only other shifter that can control  mindless Titans could it be that her  ability to summon mindless Titans is not  an ability possessed by every female  Titan but an ability unique to Annie  because Annie is in fact a member of the  royal family and her royal blood allows  her to control mindless Titans this is a  really interesting question in my mind  and I am really looking forward to  learning more about both Annie and  Arman's bloodline as the story moves  forward and I honestly can't wait to see  any emerge from that damn Crystal cocoon  because I think she still has some  important secrets to reveal about her  background so what do you guys think is  it possible that Armin and Annie have  royal blood and if so what does this  mean for the future of the story let me  know down below and of course these are  just theories speculations we don't have  definitive evidence on this so don't  think that I'm trying to convince you  I'm just trying to put the ideas out  there and start up a good conversation  if you want to discuss attack on titan  theories and other anime theories feel  free to join our discord server link in  the description we have a special  section for anime theories discussion  right there in the server if you like  these types of videos be sure to  warhammer smash that like button to let  me know and if you're new to the channel  don't forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell as always thank you so  much for watching stay tuned to the  channel for a lot more attack on titan  content and until next time see us space  cowboys  [Music]  you  [Music]

